{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIxL1dlJTIwQXJlJTIwQXMlMjBHb2RzJTIwJTI4MjAyMSUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"We Are As Gods","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/65C5nw6Rd9eWbSpFGA7BWMZRfap.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hEsGFwS7VczLyM4Sa4geZ8yo59l.jpg","description":"“We are as gods and might as well get good at it.” This is the audacious opening line of the Whole Earth Catalog, a compendium of wonderful tools compiled by counterculture legend Stewart Brand. A psychedelic experimenter, cyberspace pioneer, and environmentalist, he is now urging humanity to use our god-like powers to reframe our relationship with time and life itself. Today, Stewart is using biotech to resurrect extinct species. He and a team of scientists travel to Siberia to collect ancient DNA in an effort to make a hybrid Woolly Mammoth. Former allies in the environmental movement vow to stand in his way, but Stewart forges ahead in his life-long mission to conserve the whole earth.\n\nReleased 2 Sept 2022 · United States of America · Language: English · 90 min\nStudio: Stripe Press\n\nOn your server — Audio: English · Subtitle files: English","releaseInfo":"2021","genres":["Documentary","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.5","runtime":"90 min","cast":["Stewart Brand","Brian Eno","Kevin Kelly","George Church"],"director":["David Alvarado","Jason Sussberg"],"released":"2022-09-02T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"A film about Stewart Brand.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"David Alvarado","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2ov8iOO8jg05Adg7xVTz5do5QMR.jpg"},{"name":"Stewart Brand","character":"Himself"},{"name":"Brian Eno","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lLdYPTiwg5uvFFSY70TI3CCJYE4.jpg"},{"name":"Kevin Kelly","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lmm3a2RKQMrKkeGqf759i0kiVyJ.jpg"},{"name":"George Church","character":"Self"}]},"trailers":[{"source":"XYXyfOyKn0U","typ